ers decided to terminate the outdoor event because of heavy rain.","example_zh":"主辦方因大雨決定終止戶外活動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/terminate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-testify-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"testify","sort_order":1,"sense":"作證","alt_zh":"法庭成年女證人平靜回答法官，成年律師聆聽。","example":"The witness agreed to testify about what she had seen.","example_zh":"證人同意出庭說明她所見的情況。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/testify-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-validate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"validate","sort_order":1,"sense":"驗證","alt_zh":"成年工程師在工作桌測試小橋模型，記錄與先前資料比較。","example":"The engineer ran a second experiment to validate the results.","example_zh":"工程師進行第二次實驗以驗證結果。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/validate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vandalize-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vandalize","sort_order":1,"sense":"破壞公物","alt_zh":"公民課師生查看被刮花的公園長椅照片，討論修復，無破壞動作。","example":"The class discussed why it is wrong to vandalize public property.","example_zh":"全班討論破壞公共財物為何不對。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vandalize-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-violate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"violate","sort_order":1,"sense":"違反","alt_zh":"成年駕駛查看路邊禁止停車符號後繼續往前，清楚交通場景。","example":"Parking here would violate the town's traffic rules.","example_zh":"在這裡停車會違反鎮上的交通規定。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/violate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-withhold-01-v1","level":"senio